Make the deep-review agent load the shared review doctrine through the review mode's entry
file, `sk-code-review/SKILL.md`, instead of citing the doctrine file's own path. Four lines change.

Files (exactly two, same change in each):
1. .skilled/agents/deep-review.md
2. .claude/agents/deep-review.md

Change A. The line that starts with
`- Load the review mode's `references/review-core.md` before assigning severity:` is replaced, whole line, with:
- Load the review doctrine before assigning severity: read the review mode's `sk-code-review/SKILL.md` inside the sk-code skill, wherever the runtime installed it (in this repository: `.skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-review/SKILL.md`), and load the doctrine file it names first.

Change B. In the `### Skills` table, the row that starts with `| `sk-code` (code-review mode) |`
is replaced, whole line, with:
| `sk-code` (code-review mode) | Shared review doctrine, loaded through `sk-code-review/SKILL.md` |

Change C. The line that starts with `This agent loads shared review doctrine from the review mode's`
is replaced, whole line, with:
This agent loads shared review doctrine through the review mode's `sk-code-review/SKILL.md` inside the sk-code skill, wherever the runtime installed it (in this repository: `.skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-review/SKILL.md`), for severity definitions, evidence requirements, and baseline check families. That file names the doctrine reference as the first resource it loads.

Change D. Near the end of the file, the bullet that starts with
`- `sk-code-review/references/review-core.md` in the installed sk-code skill` is replaced, whole line, with:
- `sk-code-review/SKILL.md` in the installed sk-code skill (in this repository: `.skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-review/SKILL.md`): the review mode entry file, which names the shared review doctrine for severity and evidence.

Verification (run all, paste the output in the handback):
  rg -n 'review-core' .skilled/agents/deep-review.md .claude/agents/deep-review.md                 # expect: no output
  rg -c 'sk-code-review/SKILL.md' .skilled/agents/deep-review.md .claude/agents/deep-review.md     # expect: 4 for each file
